{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】建造業總工會公布新一年度薪酬調整安排，絕大部分工種都要凍薪。究竟建造業前景如何？政府可以做些什麼幫助業界提升競爭力？</p>\n<p>周四的時事全方位，請來工會代表分享。</p>\n<p>題目：建造業前景與工人薪酬</p>\n<p>熱線電話：1833298</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:01:26.582900+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:58.596088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:58.596088+00:00","content_hash":"0638b3eda741dcfc308cfe931c1f1b121ef013069c0750d7539ab66de9cfa4fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}